{"id":"1739c5244c36a9d3","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-ce-approximation.md","title":"c.e.集的单调有限逼近","display":"thm-ce-approximation — c.e.集的单调有限逼近","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-ce-approximation","aliases":["43-thm-ce-approximation"],"display":"thm-ce-approximation — c.e.集的单调有限逼近","depends_on":["[[43-df-ce]]","[[43-df-computable-approximation]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§5.2 and §5.6, print pp.11,18 / PDF pp.31,38","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-ce-approximation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-ce-approximation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ce-approximation — c.e.集的单调有限逼近"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e87d656c032390a9\" href=\"?note=e87d656c032390a9\" title=\"43-df-computable-approximation\">43-df-computable-approximation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§5.2 and §5.6, print pp.11,18 / PDF pp.31,38"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(g:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e87d656c032390a9\" href=\"?note=e87d656c032390a9\" title=\"43-df-computable-approximation\">43-df-computable-approximation</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists g\\ (\\operatorname{Approx}(g,A)\\land\\forall x,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(x\\ge s\\Rightarrow g(x,s)=0)\\land\\forall x,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(g(x,s)\\le g(x,s+1))).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists g\\ (\\operatorname{Approx}(g,A)\\land\\forall x,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(x\\ge s\\Rightarrow g(x,s)=0)\\land\\forall x,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(g(x,s)\\le g(x,s+1))).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>标准枚举延迟并限制第s阶段只输出小于s的元素，就满足单调性和有限支撑；反向等待某位首次变为1即可枚举。</p>\n<p>来源定位沿用附件：§5.2 and §5.6, print pp.11,18 / PDF pp.31,38。本轮核查形式化的内部一致性；未重新核对原书完整证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable-approximation","status":"resolved","id":"e87d656c032390a9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable-approximation]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-computable-approximation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable-approximation","status":"resolved","id":"e87d656c032390a9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-computable-approximation]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists g\\ (\\operatorname{Approx}(g,A)\\land\\forall x,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(x\\ge s\\Rightarrow g(x,s)=0)\\land\\forall x,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(g(x,s)\\le g(x,s+1))).","display":true}],"bytes":1258,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-45","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-ce-approximation]] — c.e.集的单调有限逼近"}],"outgoing":["6c0559518cd32104","e87d656c032390a9"]}